# Hearing it

== chat_reply_news ==
[news_reaction] [news_take?]

== news_reaction ==
No! Really?
I don't believe it.
Well, I never.
Huh.                         {taciturn, w=3}
Tell me everything!          {nosy, w=3}
You shouldn't spread stories, you know. {honest, w=2}
Is that so.                  {detached, w=2}
How wonderful!               {news=wedding}
How wonderful!               {news=engagement}
How wonderful!               {news=birth}
Oh no.                       {news=death, w=2}
Oh no. Poor [subject].       {news=death, subject_opinion=friend, w=3}
Oh no. Poor [subject].       {news=death, subject_opinion=close_friend, w=3}
[subject]? I can't believe it. {news=killing, w=2}
[subject]? I can't believe it. {news=attack}
I always knew [subject] was trouble. {news=attack, subject_opinion=disliked, w=3}
I always knew [subject] was trouble. {news=killing, subject_opinion=disliked, w=3}
That's not like [subject] at all. {news=attack, subject_opinion=friend, w=3}
That's not like [subject] at all. {news=killing, subject_opinion=friend, w=3}
Ha! Good for [subject].      {news=brawl, w=2}
Oh dear. They seemed so happy. {news=breakup, w=2}
That sounds made up.         {exaggerated=yes, w=2}
That sounds made up.         {exaggerated=yes, paranoid, w=3}

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Old news: big things from a while back, remembered together.

== chat_open_old_news ==
[listener]. [old_news_item] [old_news_take?]
[old_news_item] [old_news_take?]

== old_news_item ==
Remember [subject] and [other]'s wedding? {news=wedding}
I was just thinking about [subject] and [other]'s wedding. {news=wedding, sentimental}
Remember when [subject] and [other]'s little [baby] was born? {news=birth}
I still think about [subject] sometimes. {news=death}
I miss [subject].            {news=death, subject_opinion=friend, w=2}
I miss [subject].            {news=death, subject_opinion=close_friend, w=2}
I'll never forget what [subject] did to [other]. {news=killing}

== old_news_take ==
Feels like yesterday.        {sentimental}
Where does the time go?
Those were good days.        {news=wedding}
Those were good days.        {news=birth}
Cube God rest them.          {news=death, pious}
Some things you don't forgive. {news=killing}

== chat_reply_old_news ==
How could I forget?
Feels like yesterday.        {sentimental, w=2}
Mm.                          {taciturn, w=3}
Me too.                      {news=death, w=2}
I'd rather not talk about that. {news=killing, w=2}

