# A player asking for news, with nothing to tell.

== news_none ==
Nothing new.
Quiet lately.
Not a thing. Boring, isn't it? {nosy, w=2}
I keep to myself.            {introvert}
If I hear anything, you'll be the first to know. {polite}
Nothing worth repeating.     {honest}
